WEBVTT

00:09:29.596 --> 00:09:32.196
which will otherwise build up over time,

00:09:32.196 --> 00:09:35.356
is the key to reducing risks
in the long term.

00:09:35.396 --> 00:09:37.516
We need to do both

00:09:37.556 --> 00:09:41.636
to plot a safer course
for ourselves and our children

00:09:41.676 --> 00:09:43.516
and for generations to come.

00:09:43.556 --> 00:09:44.716
Thank you so much.

00:09:44.756 --> 00:09:49.556
(Applause)